%%% NOTES
- First handwritten line, centre of the page: "Idem" and "aussi" are uncertain readings. "aussi" might instead be another short word.
- "importantes" is written above "activités" and underlined. I placed it after "activités"; check the exact point it attaches to on the scan.
- The page number "75" is written by hand at the bottom left.
- The typed text on the scan shows through in mirror image from the other side of the sheet. It was not transcribed because it does not belong to this page.
LONG-HANDWRITING: yes
